WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.583
(gentle music)

00:00:06.085 --> 00:00:08.835
(dramatic music)

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:16.850
- [Narrator] Humpback whales.

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:27.020
They live in every ocean,

00:00:27.020 --> 00:00:30.450
traveling the high seas from
their polar feeding grounds

00:00:30.450 --> 00:00:32.603
to the tropics, where they breed.

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:40.293
Yet whales have not always
enjoyed such freedom.

00:00:43.270 --> 00:00:47.763
Once there were more then
100,000 humpbacks in the oceans,

00:00:48.670 --> 00:00:52.603
but last century, they were
hunted to near extinction.

00:00:52.603 --> 00:00:55.186
(gentle music)

00:00:58.390 --> 00:01:02.383
Just a few thousand
survived the onslaught.

00:01:02.383 --> 00:01:05.133
(dramatic music)

00:01:10.595 --> 00:01:13.933
A huge public outcry finally led to a ban

00:01:14.790 --> 00:01:17.873
on commercial whaling in 1986.

00:01:21.320 --> 00:01:24.300
Since then, the number of humpback whales

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:26.340
has been steadily increasing.

00:01:26.340 --> 00:01:28.923
(gentle music)

00:01:32.420 --> 00:01:35.180
They're returning to their
ancestral feeding grounds,

00:01:35.180 --> 00:01:37.918
like these off the coast of South Africa.

00:01:37.918 --> 00:01:40.501
(gentle music)

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:49.060
They're gathering to take advantage

00:01:49.060 --> 00:01:51.690
of a seasonal abundance of krill,

00:01:51.690 --> 00:01:54.502
tiny shrimp-like crustaceans.

00:01:54.502 --> 00:01:57.085
(cheery music)

00:02:06.360 --> 00:02:09.830
The whales take in great
mouthfuls of water,

00:02:09.830 --> 00:02:12.880
trapping the krill on
sieves of hairy bristles

00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:13.930
that line their jaws.

00:02:15.162 --> 00:02:17.912
(majestic music)

00:02:36.226 --> 00:02:39.470
Each whale can eat over a ton a day.

00:02:39.470 --> 00:02:42.220
(majestic music)

00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:12.673
With food so plentiful, fur seals come

00:03:13.950 --> 00:03:15.671
to claim their share.

00:03:15.671 --> 00:03:18.421
(majestic music)

00:03:38.420 --> 00:03:41.724
These extraordinary
scenes were unimaginable

00:03:41.724 --> 00:03:43.372
just a few years ago.

00:03:43.372 --> 00:03:46.122
(majestic music)

